WEBVTT

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:35.667
Master, here you go.

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.500
Ah, thanks.

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:48.292
<i>I am a weapon,</i>
<i>something Master despises.</i>

00:00:48.292 --> 00:00:52.625
<i>I wonder if I should go</i>
<i>on hiding this from Master.</i>

00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:04.917
<i>I wonder what Master is thinking.</i>

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:09.458
<i>Ah...</i>

00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:12.833
<i>I wanna go inside the women's bath!</i>

00:01:13.083 --> 00:01:16.125
<i>I can hear my heart bell</i>

00:01:16.125 --> 00:01:18.708
<i>dou shita tte iu no</i>

00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:22.417
<i>mune no beru ga naru</i>

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:28.000
"Heaven's Lost Property"

00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:33.958
<i>hajimari wa ano toki datta (ringin' ringin')</i>

00:01:33.958 --> 00:01:39.583
<i>kimi ga me no mae ni totsuzen (ringin' ringin')</i>

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:44.792
<i>arawareta no wa umareru mae kara</i>

00:01:44.792 --> 00:01:47.708
<i>kimerarete'ta n da ne</i>

00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:50.583
<i>kitto sou da yo</i>

00:01:50.583 --> 00:01:56.208
<i>negai ya yabou ya kuusou ga</i>

00:01:56.208 --> 00:02:01.917
<i>shiranai reberu e doa o tataite</i>

00:02:01.917 --> 00:02:08.125
<i>habataku kagi to mirai o kureru</i>
<i>(with your wings)</i>

00:02:08.125 --> 00:02:11.042
<i>I can hear my heart bell</i>

00:02:11.042 --> 00:02:14.042
<i>tomerarenai yo</i>

00:02:14.042 --> 00:02:19.625
<i>tenshi ga narashiteru</i>
<i>"daisuki" no aizu da yo ne</i>

00:02:19.625 --> 00:02:22.500
<i>can you hear my heart bell?</i>

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.958
<i>dou shita tte iu no</i>

00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:30.375
<i>kiita koto ga nai mune no beru ga naru</i>

00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:39.500
<i>sore de mo mada kimi</i>
<i>wa nani mo shiranai keredo</i>

00:02:43.667 --> 00:02:45.375
The time is the 15th century,

00:02:45.375 --> 00:02:47.833
around the start of the Age of Exploration.

00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:51.542
A young woman in Orleans followed
a voice she heard in her dreams,

00:02:51.542 --> 00:02:55.667
dressed up as a man,
and stepped forward to save the state.

00:02:56.625 --> 00:03:03.000
Now, centuries later, a young man
is following a voice heard in a dream,

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:07.292
dressing as a woman, and stepping
forward in search of the New World.

00:03:07.292 --> 00:03:10.333
Ei, that looks good on you.

00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:12.958
Cut it out, Mikako.

00:03:13.875 --> 00:03:17.000
"Off We Go To My Bathhouse Paradise"

00:03:17.375 --> 00:03:20.292
Hmm, the bathhouse?

00:03:20.292 --> 00:03:24.000
Tomo is insisting that
we all go there together.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.833
Well, I was thinking,

00:03:25.833 --> 00:03:28.542
it would be nice to have a
wide-open bath once in a while.

00:03:28.542 --> 00:03:30.333
Knowing you, Sakurai,

00:03:30.333 --> 00:03:33.458
you've got something indecent
on your mind, don't you?

00:03:33.458 --> 00:03:37.000
Oh, no. It's such a public
place, I couldn't possibly...

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:40.292
It's true, they would drag
you through the streets for that.

00:03:40.292 --> 00:03:43.000
Not that I would dislike it, though.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:47.750
<i>As if! All I have to do</i>
<i>is use one of Ikaros' cards,</i>

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:50.458
<i>and it'll be mine for the taking!</i>

00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:53.875
Okay then, Ikaros,
turn over all the cards you've got.

00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:55.208
Here.

00:03:55.208 --> 00:03:56.625
Ah, too bad.

00:03:56.625 --> 00:04:00.458
Tomo, I can tell everything
that goes through your mind.

00:04:01.417 --> 00:04:03.333
All of us girls

00:04:03.333 --> 00:04:06.000
will be going to the bathhouse
together some other time.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.875
Bye, now!

00:04:07.875 --> 00:04:11.958
I think Sakurai should
think a little bit harder.

00:04:11.958 --> 00:04:15.250
You dummy.
Your ulterior motives are plain as day.

00:04:15.958 --> 00:04:18.708
It's no use. If that's how they want it...

00:04:19.375 --> 00:04:20.417
Not interested.

00:04:20.417 --> 00:04:22.417
It's the women's bath!
The women's bath!

00:04:22.417 --> 00:04:25.833
A heaping helping of women
without a stitch of clothing on!

00:04:28.667 --> 00:04:31.083
Sugata, it's a New World.

00:04:32.958 --> 00:04:35.708
What did you just say?

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.542
Please, just think about it.

00:04:37.542 --> 00:04:41.458
Boys can go into the women's
bath until they're ten, at the oldest.

00:04:41.458 --> 00:04:47.708
Beyond that age, the opportunity for a guy to
go into the women's bath never comes again!

00:04:47.708 --> 00:04:49.667
There is no longer any way for us to know

00:04:49.667 --> 00:04:52.125
what kind of world the
women's baths really are.

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:57.958
It just might be that the New World
that we seek lies in there!

00:05:01.958 --> 00:05:03.542
Sugata, what is that?

00:05:03.542 --> 00:05:05.542
I have one card from
when I was talking to Ikaros,

00:05:05.542 --> 00:05:07.875
and asked if I could examine them.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.792
A quantum converter.
Its function is not exactly stable,

00:05:16.792 --> 00:05:19.958
but it is able to temporarily
transform a thing into something else.

00:05:19.958 --> 00:05:21.917
Use this to become a girl!

00:05:22.625 --> 00:05:25.875
But you cannot go straight
into the women's baths.

00:05:25.875 --> 00:05:27.667
First, you must become
categorically female,

00:05:27.667 --> 00:05:30.250
so that Mikako and the
others don't suspect you,

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:33.125
before you finally set out
for the New World. Got that?

00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:34.958
Understood!

00:05:35.375 --> 00:05:39.417
This will be a difficult journey.
You may not make it back.

00:05:39.417 --> 00:05:42.167
I am, of course, prepared for that.

00:05:46.917 --> 00:05:48.542
I'm home!

00:05:53.625 --> 00:05:55.042
I'm Tomoko!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.167
--So then, you used the
card to make yourself a girl?

00:05:58.167 --> 00:05:59.958
--Quantum conversion operating at 100%.
--So then, you used the card to make yourself a girl?

00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:01.042
--That's right. I'm going to live as a girl for a little while.

00:06:01.042 --> 00:06:04.167
--Metamorphosis stability all green.
--That's right. I'm going to live as a girl for a little while.

00:06:04.167 --> 00:06:07.083
At present, the situation is favorable.

00:06:09.375 --> 00:06:15.875
Now that I'm a girl, there are all
sorts of things that I want to try.

00:06:15.875 --> 00:06:18.625
<i>I'm pretty well used to looking at panties,</i>

00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:20.458
<i>but when it comes to putting them on myself,</i>

00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:22.833
<i>that's a whole different kind of fun.</i>

00:06:24.042 --> 00:06:27.583
Huh, there are pads on
the insides of these bras.

00:06:27.583 --> 00:06:29.167
I never knew.

00:06:29.167 --> 00:06:33.583
I know! Nymph, why don't you
choose some cute bras and stuff, too?

00:06:34.542 --> 00:06:38.042
Sohara said that she recommends this kind.

00:06:38.042 --> 00:06:39.083
No way!

00:06:39.083 --> 00:06:42.792
Why should I have to put on any
of this zero-functionality underwear?

00:06:42.792 --> 00:06:46.208
It offers zero armor, and its stealth factor is nil.

00:06:46.208 --> 00:06:49.458
But it's cute, isn't it? See? See?

00:06:49.458 --> 00:06:51.833
Cu-u-te!

00:06:52.833 --> 00:06:54.667
What is "cute"?

00:06:54.667 --> 00:06:59.125
<i>Whoa! That is one tough question.</i>

00:07:00.083 --> 00:07:03.417
All right, I'll show you what "cute" is.

00:07:09.583 --> 00:07:12.292
Look, look! Cute, right?

00:07:14.917 --> 00:07:19.958
How about this frill? Well? Isn't it girly?

00:07:19.958 --> 00:07:23.167
It is very cute, Master.

00:07:23.167 --> 00:07:26.500
Say, Tomoki, are you
happy when something is "cute"?

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:29.250
Hmm... I'm not sure I'd call it happy,

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:31.542
it's more like a feast for the eyes.

00:07:31.542 --> 00:07:33.375
I get it.

00:07:41.125 --> 00:07:45.167
How's this, Tomoki? Is this cute?

00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:48.000
Uh, mm-hmm.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.458
Oh, good. Okay, I'll buy these.

00:08:01.167 --> 00:08:03.375
<i>Now that I've gone and become a girl,</i>

00:08:03.375 --> 00:08:06.833
<i>I'll make myself really popular at school.</i>

00:08:14.792 --> 00:08:17.625
S-Sorry. Are you all right?

00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:23.958
Oh, no! Naughty boy...

00:08:26.625 --> 00:08:28.750
H-How cute!

00:08:30.125 --> 00:08:31.792
What was that just now?

00:08:31.792 --> 00:08:33.458
The transfer student payoff scene.

00:08:33.458 --> 00:08:36.917
This is how the heroine
has to make her entrance.

00:08:36.917 --> 00:08:39.625
I don't know what you mean.

00:08:39.625 --> 00:08:42.750
Ah, good morning,
Ikaros and Nymph.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.292
Huh? Where's Tomo?

00:08:45.292 --> 00:08:47.250
He said he had a cold,
and was staying home.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:52.708
You're kidding! Tomo?
He almost never gets sick.

00:08:52.708 --> 00:08:56.833
That worries me. Maybe I'll
go check on him after school.

00:08:56.833 --> 00:08:58.042
That's all right.

00:08:58.042 --> 00:09:02.042
Tomoki said it's not a big deal,
and not to worry about it.

00:09:02.042 --> 00:09:04.458
Right, Alpha?

00:09:04.458 --> 00:09:06.500
Oh, okay. Huh?

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.625
Pleased to meet you. I'm the new
transfer student, Tomoko.

00:09:09.625 --> 00:09:12.583
I hope you'll be nice to me.

00:09:12.583 --> 00:09:15.417
Likewise! Nice to meet you.

00:09:16.792 --> 00:09:21.500
<i>All right! Sohara is still</i>
<i>in the dark. I'm on a roll!</i>

00:09:22.292 --> 00:09:28.250
Making sweets is sort of my hobby.
I baked some cookies. Try one!

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:31.708
--I'll take one.
--Don't mind if I do.

00:09:31.708 --> 00:09:33.375
--Bleh!
--Yuck!

00:09:33.375 --> 00:09:38.000
Oh, no, I must have
mistaken the salt for the sugar.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:39.875
I'm such a dummy.

00:09:39.875 --> 00:09:41.708
H-How cute!

00:09:41.792 --> 00:09:42.917
"Home Economics"

00:09:47.875 --> 00:09:52.875
I just barely transferred here,
so this is all I have.

00:09:52.875 --> 00:09:54.167
Does it look good on me-ow?

00:09:54.167 --> 00:09:56.125
H-How cute!

00:09:56.125 --> 00:09:59.792
Say, is that what
Tomoki meant by "cute"?

00:09:59.792 --> 00:10:03.125
Could this be Master's
image of the ideal woman?

00:10:04.208 --> 00:10:07.208
Like this--meow?

00:10:07.208 --> 00:10:08.000
Meow.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.417
"Barnyard Sonata"

00:10:09.417 --> 00:10:11.833
Miss Umako, are you awake?

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.083
Tomoko, I have a present.

00:10:16.083 --> 00:10:17.167
Look over here!

00:10:17.167 --> 00:10:19.750
Oh, dear, what am I to do?

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:22.542
Tomoko is really popular, huh?

00:10:22.542 --> 00:10:24.667
She's like a two-dimensional
girl you'd find

00:10:24.667 --> 00:10:27.042
in some misguided manual.

00:10:27.042 --> 00:10:31.083
I'm sure that's the kind
of girl that boys idealize.

00:10:31.083 --> 00:10:34.083
This is educational, in a sense.

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.125
"Girls changing! No peeking!!"

00:10:37.417 --> 00:10:40.875
<i>It's here at last! Gym class!</i>

00:10:40.875 --> 00:10:44.875
<i>Remain calm, and charge on in!</i>

00:10:54.458 --> 00:10:57.792
<i>It's good to be alive!</i>

00:10:57.792 --> 00:11:01.583
Ah, Tomoko, the locker
next to mine is available.

00:11:01.583 --> 00:11:02.667
Over here!

00:11:02.667 --> 00:11:04.083
Mm-hmm.

00:11:08.083 --> 00:11:11.875
I'm so sorry! I'm such a klutz!

00:11:11.875 --> 00:11:14.208
Tomoko, you really are cute.

00:11:14.208 --> 00:11:16.833
Tomo will probably go
nuts when he meets you.

00:11:16.833 --> 00:11:17.500
Huh?

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:22.750
Oh, Tomo is a boy in our class
that I've known since we were kids.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:24.625
He isn't here today, though.

00:11:24.625 --> 00:11:27.333
He's a sick, full-on perv,

00:11:27.333 --> 00:11:29.208
who loves panties,

00:11:29.208 --> 00:11:31.500
and though he may appear
to be a peace-loving, docile boy,

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.250
he has the heart of a wolf,

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.792
so you should be careful around him, Tomoko.

00:11:35.792 --> 00:11:38.083
<i>She said all that?!</i>

00:11:38.083 --> 00:11:39.917
But to be fair,

00:11:39.917 --> 00:11:42.167
if someone is in trouble,
he doesn't just stand around,

00:11:42.167 --> 00:11:46.958
and he does have a
lot of warm, kind qualities, too.

00:11:46.958 --> 00:11:49.625
Oh, nothing. Just thinking out loud.

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:52.417
You pass.

00:11:52.417 --> 00:11:56.250
I have observed your actions all day, Tomoki.

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:59.000
Your speech, your behavioral
patterns, your actions...

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.750
You've passed all baseline
criteria for being a normal girl.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:03.792
You may have overdone
it a little on the clumsiness,

00:12:03.792 --> 00:12:06.000
but for whatever reason,
you've won over some fans,

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.292
and went over favorably.

00:12:07.292 --> 00:12:08.417
Thanx!

00:12:08.417 --> 00:12:11.292
It was worth it for me,
too, as your coach.

00:12:11.292 --> 00:12:13.833
Not even the keen-witted
Mikako is likely to catch on.

00:12:13.833 --> 00:12:15.583
It's time for the main event, Tomoki.

00:12:15.583 --> 00:12:20.542
Please, call me Tomoko, sweetie.

00:12:20.542 --> 00:12:22.500
Huh? The bathhouse?

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:26.542
Ikaros says she desperately
wants to go with everyone.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:30.458
And who are you?

00:12:30.458 --> 00:12:32.458
I'm Tomoko.

00:12:33.917 --> 00:12:37.167
Um, I just transferred here,

00:12:37.167 --> 00:12:38.792
but even at my last school,

00:12:38.792 --> 00:12:41.958
I've really looked forward to
meeting you, Miss Chairman.

00:12:41.958 --> 00:12:46.292
I've wanted to get to
know you for a long, long time.

00:12:46.292 --> 00:12:51.167
So today, I would love to come
to the bathhouse together with you!

00:12:51.167 --> 00:12:53.875
Oh, yeah? That's fine with me.

00:12:53.875 --> 00:12:55.500
Yes!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.792
Tomo is at home, so
for this rare opportunity,

00:12:58.792 --> 00:13:02.042
we won't have to worry about
him peeking at us if we go now.

00:13:02.042 --> 00:13:06.000
Yes. Well then, let's all go together.

00:13:08.292 --> 00:13:10.292
<i>Outstanding, Tomoki!</i>

00:13:15.167 --> 00:13:17.958
<i>And now, to the New World!</i>

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:23.125
"Heaven's Lost Property"

00:13:31.125 --> 00:13:34.125
I haven't been to the
bathhouse in a long time.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:57.167
<i>Nice!</i>

00:13:57.167 --> 00:14:01.125
<i>Any way you look at her,</i>
<i>Tomoko is every bit a girl.</i>

00:14:01.125 --> 00:14:04.792
<i>That's right. You apparently see it, too, Tomoki.</i>

00:14:04.792 --> 00:14:08.792
<i>Your blending in at the baths</i>
<i>shows that you are a full-fledged girl!</i>

00:14:10.708 --> 00:14:14.417
<i>This truly is a whole New World!</i>

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:22.833
Master, your pulse is becoming
erratic. Be extra careful.

00:14:22.833 --> 00:14:25.000
So this is where you are.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.500
I must closely control
Master's metamorphosis.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.542
This must be hard on you, Alpha.

00:14:30.542 --> 00:14:32.917
Don't you find it silly to be doing this?

00:14:32.917 --> 00:14:34.750
Master ordered me to.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:37.250
Hmph, ordered you, huh?

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:43.917
I guess you'd follow such a happy-go-lucky
order without question, huh?

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:50.417
It must be nice being you.
You've got no worries, do you?

00:14:50.417 --> 00:14:52.792
That's not true.

00:14:52.792 --> 00:14:54.958
Remember, Nymph?

00:14:54.958 --> 00:14:58.708
You once asked me how long
I could go on fooling Master.

00:15:03.708 --> 00:15:06.042
If Master ever finds out the truth,

00:15:06.042 --> 00:15:10.167
I am sure that he will start disliking me.

00:15:11.208 --> 00:15:15.000
But I do not know if it is right
to go on hiding this from Master--

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:17.958
or to go on lying to him.

00:15:20.333 --> 00:15:22.958
You've got nothing to
worry about with Tomoki.

00:15:22.958 --> 00:15:28.833
These Downers are all fools,
after all. I'm sure he'll never catch on.

00:15:30.083 --> 00:15:31.833
Chairman...

00:15:31.833 --> 00:15:36.875
Um, if it's all right, can I wash your back?

00:15:36.875 --> 00:15:40.292
Sure. I guess I can ask you to do that.

00:15:40.292 --> 00:15:42.292
<i>Ye-e-s!!</i>

00:15:44.667 --> 00:15:47.875
<i>My hands have been waiting for this moment!</i>

00:15:47.875 --> 00:15:49.958
<i>My desires have been waiting for this moment!</i>

00:15:49.958 --> 00:15:53.875
<i>Now is the time when I take</i>
<i>my first step into a new land!</i>

00:15:53.875 --> 00:15:55.875
<i>Here goes!</i>

00:15:57.958 --> 00:16:00.708
Whoops! My hands slipped!

00:16:00.708 --> 00:16:03.833
I'm so sorry, Chairman!

00:16:03.833 --> 00:16:07.000
<i>Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes!</i>

00:16:08.083 --> 00:16:10.500
Is something the matter?

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:15.000
There is an abnormality in part of
the metamorphosis of Master's body.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:18.875
Danger, Master. If this state
of excitement continues,

00:16:18.875 --> 00:16:22.292
the possibility exists of deforming
into something unknown.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:25.167
Um, Master...?

00:16:25.167 --> 00:16:27.500
Sohara, I'll wash you, too.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.750
--I-I'm fine...

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.083
--Don't be shy.
--I-I'm fine...

00:16:30.083 --> 00:16:33.792
Come on, we're all girls here, after all.

00:16:37.833 --> 00:16:39.583
That tickles!

00:16:39.583 --> 00:16:42.583
Yes! Ye-e-s!!

00:16:42.583 --> 00:16:44.000
Yes!

00:16:44.375 --> 00:16:45.792
Yes!

00:16:47.042 --> 00:16:48.833
Yes!

00:16:48.833 --> 00:16:50.875
Master, do you read me?

00:16:50.875 --> 00:16:52.875
Um, Master?

00:16:55.458 --> 00:16:58.042
We're all girls here!

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.667
Yes!!

00:17:02.583 --> 00:17:04.000
Yes!!

00:17:04.458 --> 00:17:06.792
Yes!!

00:17:06.792 --> 00:17:09.375
We're all girls here!

00:17:12.125 --> 00:17:16.625
<i>He appears to have completely</i>
<i>lost control of himself.</i>

00:17:16.625 --> 00:17:18.875
What has come over Tomoko?

00:17:18.875 --> 00:17:25.125
What carnage. Not that I dislike it, though.

00:17:25.125 --> 00:17:27.583
Ah, this has become a real mess.

00:17:27.583 --> 00:17:30.792
Master, please calm down. If this keeps up,

00:17:30.792 --> 00:17:33.292
the quantum converter might...

00:17:33.292 --> 00:17:35.542
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:17:35.542 --> 00:17:39.792
Yes! Yes! Ye-e-s!!

00:17:43.083 --> 00:17:44.500
Why...

00:17:45.667 --> 00:17:48.667
...have you got a faucet
coming out of here?

00:17:51.958 --> 00:17:54.250
It can take no more.

00:18:01.417 --> 00:18:04.208
Well, I'll just be going...

00:18:08.083 --> 00:18:12.875
U-Um, Sohara, your towel has fallen off...

00:18:12.875 --> 00:18:15.917
That's okay. Right now,
any embarrassment I have

00:18:15.917 --> 00:18:17.792
at being seen naked doesn't matter.

00:18:17.792 --> 00:18:21.792
Right now, all I want to do is kill you, Tomo!

00:18:29.125 --> 00:18:32.583
You have to know when to quit, Tomoki.

00:18:34.625 --> 00:18:37.125
Come on, clean faster!

00:18:37.125 --> 00:18:39.125
Yes, I'm sorry!

00:18:40.458 --> 00:18:43.708
We can finally take our time in the bath now.

00:18:43.708 --> 00:18:46.708
It's all right. There's no one else here now.

00:18:52.833 --> 00:18:54.250
This feels good.

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.917
Yeah, this is great.

00:18:55.917 --> 00:18:58.333
Ikaros, you've got your wings,

00:18:58.333 --> 00:19:02.208
and Nymph, you seemed to be
concerned about your collar,

00:19:02.208 --> 00:19:04.500
so it must have been hard
for you to come into the bath.

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:08.792
I'm sorry, I didn't even
realize that about you two.

00:19:08.792 --> 00:19:14.125
I always think of you as being
regular girls, Ikaros and Nymph,

00:19:14.125 --> 00:19:18.292
and I just forgot that you're Angeloids.

00:19:18.292 --> 00:19:20.708
I am glad to hear that.

00:19:20.708 --> 00:19:25.875
That you think of me
as a regular girl, Sohara.

00:19:25.875 --> 00:19:30.792
I want to become even
more human, for Master's sake.

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:36.375
Ikaros, you're fine just the way you are.

00:19:36.375 --> 00:19:39.792
You shouldn't want to
become more human so badly

00:19:39.792 --> 00:19:42.583
that you would force yourself
to lie, like you did before.

00:19:42.583 --> 00:19:44.083
Promise me?

00:19:44.083 --> 00:19:46.167
Lying is bad?

00:19:46.167 --> 00:19:49.458
Mm-hmm. You shouldn't tell lies.

00:19:49.458 --> 00:19:55.417
♪ Pinky promise, hope to die,
stick a needle in my eye, okay? ♪

00:20:05.958 --> 00:20:10.042
<i>I have to tell Master the truth.</i>

00:20:10.042 --> 00:20:13.792
Oh, good for you. They let you have a bath.

00:20:13.792 --> 00:20:16.750
The bathhouse's old
lady made me clean the baths

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.000
--before she let me off the hook.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.750
--Master...
--before she let me off the hook.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:22.500
I need to tell you something important.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:25.917
I have been keeping something
back from you, Master.

00:20:25.917 --> 00:20:28.417
But once I tell you this,

00:20:28.417 --> 00:20:30.792
I am sure...

00:20:30.792 --> 00:20:34.292
<i>...you will hate me, Master...</i>

00:20:39.667 --> 00:20:42.250
Ikaros, nicely done.

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:46.125
You've gone and become a
little more human, haven't you?

00:20:46.125 --> 00:20:50.625
Humans always keep
a thing or two to themselves.

00:20:50.625 --> 00:20:51.708
Don't we?

00:20:51.708 --> 00:20:53.250
Master...

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:54.167
It's all right.

00:20:54.167 --> 00:20:56.625
I... I...

00:20:56.625 --> 00:20:58.667
It's all right.

00:21:01.417 --> 00:21:04.917
You can tell me when you're ready.
We're family, after all.

00:21:04.917 --> 00:21:07.083
Yes...

00:21:07.083 --> 00:21:11.083
There, you see? You've got
nothing to worry about with Tomoki.

00:21:13.375 --> 00:21:16.375
How happy you must
be to have a nice master.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:23.375
Sugata, what are Angeloids, anyhow?

00:21:23.375 --> 00:21:27.375
I've thought to myself,
I sure would like having a maid robot,

00:21:27.375 --> 00:21:31.500
who would do whatever
I ordered her to do. Still,

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:36.750
I don't like to see Ikaros
suffering the way she does over me.

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:40.333
The only thing I know

00:21:40.333 --> 00:21:43.417
is that there is a New World,
far above our heads,

00:21:43.417 --> 00:21:47.542
and that Ikaros and Nymph
are even now being held captive

00:21:47.542 --> 00:21:49.833
by that world in the sky.

00:21:51.833 --> 00:21:56.417
Who is it that created
the Angeloids, anyway?

00:21:57.375 --> 00:21:59.375
I'd like to slug him one.

00:22:08.625 --> 00:22:15.417
<i>Shaking loose from the hold</i>

00:22:15.417 --> 00:22:21.333
<i>of burning arms, you come away</i>

00:22:21.333 --> 00:22:27.292
<i>Trembling slightly in your white robe,</i>

00:22:27.292 --> 00:22:32.292
<i>I saw your aging grief</i>

00:22:34.208 --> 00:22:40.208
<i>In the long hallway</i>
<i>heading to the ring,</i>

00:22:40.208 --> 00:22:46.833
<i>for some reason, you suddenly stopped,</i>

00:22:46.833 --> 00:22:50.375
<i>spun around, and showed me</i>

00:22:50.375 --> 00:22:57.083
<i>your fists and a lonesome smile</i>

00:22:59.625 --> 00:23:05.708
<i>Before long, the swirl</i>
<i>of applause and the ring</i>

00:23:05.708 --> 00:23:11.500
<i>swallowed up a man</i>

00:23:11.500 --> 00:23:13.333
<i>(You're the king of kings)</i>

00:23:13.333 --> 00:23:19.833
<i>Stand up on your own two feet again</i>

00:23:19.833 --> 00:23:25.833
<i>Stand up and let</i>
<i>the flame of your life burn</i>

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:36.833
Sure enough, it looks like the
Beta is completely useless on her own.

00:23:36.833 --> 00:23:40.708
She might run away if this keeps up.
Are you sure about this?

00:23:40.708 --> 00:23:45.750
Not to worry. As long as
I hold this chain, she can't run away.

00:23:45.750 --> 00:23:49.167
Besides, I've already decided to scrap her.

00:23:49.167 --> 00:23:51.208
You're such an awful person.

00:23:52.625 --> 00:23:55.042
Yeah, I can't wait.

00:23:55.042 --> 00:23:59.042
It's been a while since I've looked
forward to something this much.

00:24:03.917 --> 00:24:08.086
Next time, "Chains of No Escape"
